sy with others Anna gets upset and  quietly leaves the party however she  gets kidnapped by Arena's henchman and  is dropped off to another world to  ensure she never meets KIRO again KIRO  on the other hand starts looking for  Anna the party and after failing to  locate her he returns to the tower there  a member of the committee surprises him  and secretly assigns him to a task to  open a door to Utopia where no one is  allowed to go she claims that Utopia is  the real world and all other worlds are  merely copies of it in Utopia there's no  hatred intolerance or disease there  people live happily and in peace the  Committee Member wants Carol to find out  the secret of the real world's success  so that other worlds can learn from them  kiril accepts the mission but he is  still concerned about Anna the next day  he looks up Anna's house on the map and  it's 15 kilometers away from the tower  he knows going that far from the tower  will kill him but he doesn't care as  long as he gets to meet his love  expectedly his condition deteriorates as  he approaches her home but to keep  himself from dying he eats the snow he  eventually makes it to her home but is  disappointed when he doesn't find her  there at last he returns to the tower  where he notices that entry to another  world has opened this one's seems like a  dystopian Gulag with impoverished  civilians there everyone works for a  factory that is owned by a woman who is  revealed to be the world's custom  officer when she learns that Carol is a  customs officer from another world she  asks him to deliver a speech to motivate  her workers Carol agrees and in the  crowd he notices Anna who appears to be  weak it turns out that rina's henchmen  abandoned Anna in this world knowing  that the Customs officer would never let  Anna walk away KIRO cleverly crowds her  with her own workers and proceeds to run  away with Anna they are chased but  eventually managed to get back to the  lighthouse a while later Katya arr